;---------------------------------------
; BEGIN DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------
<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "日常.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\イタリアンレストラン.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>The day of the group date―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The place I was brought to was an Italian bar-restaurant that had recently opened in Motoki-cho.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
New shops like this one were starting to open one after another in Motoki-cho.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
As promised, I was going to be introduced to a colleague of <STYLE ID="1">Ryoji-san</STYLE>'s, but...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ母.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"We got here a little early. Let's wait inside."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Uugh... Is he even going to like someone like me..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"You've come this far. You're not going to say you're going home, are you?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"I'm not going to go home, not at this point, but... Will I be able to talk properly..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\風呂ドア.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\イタリアンテーブル.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
The table we were shown to was set with glasses and plates for four.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even if it was a small one, this still counted as a group date, didn't it?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'd been told I didn't need to worry about the money, but I was nervous all the same...<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Hey... what am I supposed to talk about... Talking properly with a man..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ母.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"We'll steer things along, so you'll be fine. </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Ryoji-kun</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">'s going to help out all the way too. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Let's practice a little."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Uugh... go easy on me..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Okay, introduce yourself."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"What?! What do I even say in a self-introduction?!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"You can at least say your name and your age, can't you?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Uugh... um, my name is... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Mifuyu... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4" RUBY="かない">Kanai</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"What are you, a foreigner..." [TN: In Japanese the family name comes first.]</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"I hate this...! I can't even say my own name in practice...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ母腕組み.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Honestly, you're hopeless... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Here."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\紙ペラ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\手紙.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">Akane</STYLE> handed me a sheet of paper.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"I wrote a self-introduction list on that for you, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Mifuyu</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Just look at it and talk slowly."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The paper had not only my name on it, but my background, my hobbies and so on.
{CREATECG "リファレンス解禁画像" "グラフィック\システム\リファレンス解禁画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "81" "600" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Listen. You can look at the paper, but always keep your eyes on </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Eiichiro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Uugh... I'll try..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
These were awfully detailed notes.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This was the first time we'd met since making plans for the group date, but <STYLE ID="2">Akane</STYLE> had seemed busy lately.<PG>
That was because <STYLE ID="2">Akane</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="1">Ryoji-san</STYLE> had decided to get married, and she was starting on the preparations.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The ceremony was planned for 10 months from now, and she had found time in between all that to write these notes for me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Besides, only <STYLE ID="2">Akane</STYLE>, who knows me so well, could have written this.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
After seeing this, I really couldn't treat this match lightly.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\風呂ドア.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Oh, looks like they're here."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
By reflex my whole back straightened, and my breath stopped.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "環境音\鼓動1.ogg" "VOICE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
They're finally here...! I can't drag <STYLE ID="2">Akane</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">'s</STYLE> name through the mud.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It'll be fine! <STYLE ID="2">Akane</STYLE> and the others set this up, so he has to be a wonderful person!<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\良治正面バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "アイテム1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Oh. I thought we'd get here first, but you two are pretty early..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"I wanted to get </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Mifuyu</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> used to the place, even a little."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The one next to <STYLE ID="1">Ryoji-san</STYLE> was...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "5000" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\栄一郎バストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">"Oh... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">uhh..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Was this man <STYLE ID="5">Eiichiro Niimura-san</STYLE>?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "日曜日の朝.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
Just as I'd heard, he was short, and his build was clearly over the standard.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
His face was hard to call handsome, but...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But looks don't matter at all.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What matters is whether he fits my weighty ideal: whether he could become my family...<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Come on, </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Eiichiro</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, sit down."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5"><TXSPS>"Phew... phew..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<TXSPN>This <STYLE ID="5">Eiichiro-san</STYLE> person was sweating a lot and breathing hard.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Maybe <STYLE ID="5">he</STYLE> was nervous too...<PG>
{PLAYSND "SE\軽くぶつかる.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="7">"Ow!"</STYLE><BR>
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物1\r\n4\r\n540\r\n300\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "300" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物1\r\n4\r\n540\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "200" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\down1.ogg" "VOICE2" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE2" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="7">Eiichiro-san</STYLE> caught his foot on empty air and fell over.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Hey, you okay?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物1\r\n4\r\n150\r\n2000\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{QUAKE "人物1" "QUAKE" "1" "5" "5" "0" "30"}
<STYLE ID="7"><TXSPS>"I-I-I-I'm fime...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1"><TXSPN>Ryoji-san</STYLE> held him up, and at last he made it to his seat.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If he's that nervous, it's going to make me even more nervous...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1,人物2" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{QUAKESTOP "0"}
{MESON "500"}
―Before long, the drinks for the toast arrived.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\イタリアンテーブル.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ母.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\良治正面バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"This time it's supposed to be about introducing </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Eiichiro</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Mifuyu-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, but let's just have fun and keep it easy."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Right, let's keep it easy. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Okay, cheers."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\栄一郎バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">"Ah... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">ah, wait!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\栄一郎頭かく.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">"U-um, hey... </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Ryoji</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Akane-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">... you're getting married, right? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">　Then I'd like the toast to celebrate that as well..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">Eiichiro-san</STYLE> sure is considerate. There's no doubt he's a good person.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"R-right! This time let's celebrate the two of you getting married!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ母腕組み.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Thank you, both of you. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">But never mind that. You two are the stars today."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\良治バストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Right, right. We're the supporting cast."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1,人物2,人物3" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Okay, cheers!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\乾杯.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{PLAYSND "SE\ごくり.ogg" "VOICE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="5">"Gulp gulp gulp gulp...!"</STYLE>
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "500" "PASS"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\イタリアンテーブル.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\栄一郎バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">Eiichiro-san</STYLE> drained his beer in one go.<PG>
When I looked closer, his face was bright red and his hands were shaking.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
His eyes were a little sharp, and the muscles in his face were twitching.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Maybe, rather than nervous, he was angry?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Had he seen through me, seen that I'm a mopey, good-for-nothing woman...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\椅子から立つ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\栄一郎頭かく.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">"S-s-sorry! Just going to the restroom!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And <STYLE ID="5">Eiichiro-san</STYLE> shot a look at <STYLE ID="1">Ryoji-san</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\良治バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Oh, I'll go too."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1,人物2" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
The two of them got up from the table at the same time.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Could this be...! The thing that always happens at group dates, where they go off and trash the other side behind their backs?!<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "ごろごろゲームする日_2.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\イタリアントイレ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="7">"Hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Ryoji</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">...! Give me a break...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Huh? </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Mifuyu-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s not to your liking?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"That's not it! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">　Why'd you have to bring a </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">beauty</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> like that, of all people! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">　Any way you look at it, I'm no match for her!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Don't strain so hard. I think </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'re a good match for her."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"Damn it. I hate this face and this body..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Come on, </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Eiichiro</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, ready yet?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"R-right...! Now's the time to show them the soul of the Arata settlement! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">　Fighting spirit! Fighting spirit!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
